  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dreamspace.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the acolyte dreaming hedgewitch secret. You may use this feat to qualify for the Extra Secret feat, but may only use it to select additional instances of the acolyte dreaming secret.</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> If you do not have hedgewitch levels, you may use your character level as your effective hedgewitch level for determining the power of the acolyte dreaming hedgewitch secret.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
